icles before bidding to ensure a court order and bill of sale are sufficient for titling and registration purposes. The buyer is responsible for titling the vehicle in their residing county/state within 90 days of the close of the auction/bill of sale issuance.\n**GUARANTY WAIVER:** All property is offered for sale AS IS, WHERE IS. The seller makes no warranty, guarantee, or representation of any kind, expressed or implied, regarding the merchantability, cleanliness, or fitness for any purpose of the property offered for sale. PAYMENT MUST BE MADE ONLINE. A daily storage fee of $10.00 may be charged for any item not removed within the 10 business days, as stated on the Buyer's Certificate. Items will be considered abandoned property, and payment will be forfeited if not picked up within 20 business days of the issued Buyer's Certificate. Upon the removal of property, all sales are final.",
